@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Kari's EV charger quote: Ola creates a draft from the van
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "EV charger installation",
  "customer": { "name": "Kari Nordmann", "email": "kari@example.com", "siteAddress": "Fjellveien 12, 5019 Bergen" },
  "lines": [
    { "type": "Labour",   "description": "Installation, electrician", "quantity": 5,  "unit": "h",   "unitPrice": 950,  "vatRate": 0.25 },
    { "type": "Material", "description": "EV charger 11 kW",          "quantity": 1,  "unit": "pcs", "unitPrice": 8990, "vatRate": 0.25 },
    { "type": "Material", "description": "Cable 5x6 mm²",             "quantity": 15, "unit": "m",   "unitPrice": 89,   "vatRate": 0.25 },
    { "type": "Other",    "description": "Call-out / travel",         "quantity": 1,  "unit": "pcs", "unitPrice": 690,  "vatRate": 0.25 }
  ]
}

### Get it back: the ETag header carries the version used for If-Match
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### List: newest first, filter and search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes?status=Draft&search=kari&page=1&pageSize=20

### Validation error: missing customer, line without vatRate, too many decimals (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broken",
  "lines": [ { "type": "Labour", "description": "Work", "quantity": 1.0001, "unit": "h", "unitPrice": 100 } ]
}
